From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:49:52 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] ci: cut pipeline - release gate on a self-hosted Linux
 runner, then tag and release

cut.yml (workflow_dispatch only, runs-on [self-hosted, linux]): stage
gate runs `cargo xtask gate release --no-snapshots` on release/vX.Y.0
and uploads gate-logs/; stage tag, after the release PR merged, checks
main is the merge of the gated tip with an empty diff, tags it and starts
the existing release.yml on the tag (gh workflow run --ref). dry_run
input on both. release.yml is unchanged.

xtask: `gate release --no-snapshots` drops the two Windows-golden pixel
lanes. AGENTS.md: cut steps 2-4, Actions budget, the cut runner's
requirements and registration. PROCESS_VERSION 55.

Fixes #1413

